expect: ok

--- OUT --->
Alice
Bob
Charlie
5
5
1.500000
--- RAST --->
CHECK: Module: [main]
// the inference itself, which OUT cannot show: three declarations, three element types, none of
// them written down. and one destructor each - a body holding an unexpanded literal is not
// concrete, so the ownership pass waited for the expansion rather than walking past it
CHECK: vardecl<type<Array<string>>>($names) = call Array(): Array<string>
CHECK: vardecl<type<Array<int32>>>($numbers) = call Array(): Array<int32>
CHECK: vardecl<type<Array<float64>>>($ratios) = call Array(): Array<float64>
CHECK: call destructor(addrof<Array<float64>&>
CHECK: call destructor(addrof<Array<int32>&>
CHECK: call destructor(addrof<Array<string>&>
